A struct the new version removes, that nothing maps or drops, is reported
once, as a whole: dropping it, rather than its fields one by one, keeps
whether it was present.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	name: string
	meta?: {
		owner?: string
		team?:  string
	}
}
-- ship/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	name: string
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	v1_0: {
		name: v0_0.name
	}
}
-- out/error --
error[E0347]: 0.0 declares meta and 1.0 does not, and nothing maps it: write <field>: v0_0.meta to move it, or meta: _drop
 --> 1.0.thema:5:1
  |
5 | ForwardLens: {
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^
  |
